1</i>. At the Annual Meeting, five nominees for director were elected to serve until the next annual meeting of stockholders or until
their respective successors have been duly elected and qualified, or until such director&#8217;s earlier resignation, removal or death.
The result of the votes to elect the five directors were as follows:</span></p>

